Fatima Sa Roti Hai Karbal Ka Nazaara Dekhkar<br>
nargha E Aada Me Bete Ko Akela Dekhkar<br>
<br>
1. Hogaya Pamaal Ran Me Ibne Shabbar Ka Badan<br>
chunte Hain Shabbir Tukde Zarra Zarra Dekhkar<br>
<br>
2. Kat Gaye Ghazi Ke Shaane Paani Laane Ke Liye<br>
pyaase Bacche Rehgaye Mashke Sakina Dekhkar<br>
 <br>
3. Seena E Akbar As Me Naiza Aur Jawaa'n Bete Ka Gham<br>
haste Jaate Hain Sitamgar Sheh Ka Girna Dekhkar<br>
<br>
4. Akbar As O Abbas As O Qasim As Saare Maqtal Jaa Chuke<br>
aagaye Asghar Bhi Ran Me Sheh Ko Tanha Dekhkar<br>
<br>
5. Teen Din Ka Pyaasa Baccha Hath Par Shabbir Ke<br>
roti Hai Khud Alqama Asghar Ko Pyaasa Dekhkar<br>
<br>
6. Hath Me Sughra Ka Khat Hai Godh Me Ashgar Ki Laash<br>
chehra E Asghar Ko Chooma Sheh Ne Naama Dekhkar<br>
<br>
7. Shumre Ka Khanjar Hai Aur Sukha Gala Shabbir Ka<br>
di Sada Ghazi Ko Shai Ne Sooye Darya Dekhakar<br>
<br>
8. Sar Juda Hai Jism Se Aur Hai Badan Me Lakho Teer<br>
roti Hai Baali Sakina Sheh Ka Seena Dekhkar<br>
<br>
9. Bibiyaa'n Karti Hai Girya Ek Chadar Bhi Nahi<br>
jism Sarwar Ka Pada Hai Paara Paara Dekhkar<br>
<br>
10. Bekafan Uryaa'n Pada Hai Dasht Me Ibne Ali As<br>
deer Tak Sajjad As Roye Sheh Ka Laasha Dekhkar<br>
<br>
11. Nouke Naiza Se Wo Girna Aur Rona Ghazi Ka<br>
zainab Sa O Kulsoom Sa Ka Wo Sar Barehna Dekhkar<br>
<br>
12. Saath Sau Kursi Nashee'n Hai Aur Zainab Berida <br>
aagayi Darbaar Me Bhayya Ka Chehra Dekhkar<br>
<br>
13. Na Hawa Hai Na Ghiza Hai Aur Andhera Har Taraf<br>
kehti Hai Baali Sakina Sa Khaid Khaana Dekhkar <br>
<br>
14. Aati Hai Ammar Dekho Majliso Mai Fatema S.a<br>
roti Jaati Hai Azadaro Ka Rona Dekhkar<br>
